  <div class="clay" style="padding:34px 44px;text-align:center;min-width:330px"><div class="serif" style="font-size:70px;font-weight:800;color:#2e6b45">46</div><p class="muted" style="font-size:21px">lượt tải phần mềm mở</p></div>
  <div class="clay" style="padding:34px 44px;text-align:center;min-width:330px"><div class="serif" style="font-size:70px;font-weight:800;color:#3d5a96">464</div><p class="muted" style="font-size:21px">commit · riêng tháng 8/2026</p></div>
